**The cryptic exon lies in GNG10 (HGNC symbol; Ensembl ENSG00000242616), a
protein-coding gene on chromosome 9.**

| item | value |
|---|---|
| Gene | GNG10 (protein-coding, + strand) |
| Cryptic exon | {chrom}:{cs}-{ce} ({ce - cs + 1} bp) |
